            <p><strong>S. Phaneuf & Associates</strong> delivers full-service commercial paving, site excavation, and architectural <a href="/middlesex-county/hardscape-contractor-lexington-ma">stone masonry</a> for commercial hubs and high-end residential estates in <strong>Lexington, Massachusetts</strong>. Operating in Middlesex County, site work demands rigorous engineering to manage high-traffic commercial loads, dense suburban utility grids, and severe winter ground-heaving. Inadequate subgrade preparation leads to immediate asphalt rutting, potholes, and paver shifting. S. Phaneuf & Associates solves these issues by executing precision sub-base compaction, installing commercial catch basin drainage systems, and paving with heavy-duty MassDOT asphalt mixtures built for Lexington's climate.</p>
